# Denzilore Fatehold: "Whenever you scry or surveil, put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control." Bot1 casts
# Ornithopter and Denzilore on turn 1 (Black Lotus and Mox Pearl); Bot2 casts an Ornithopter of its own on turn 2. On
# turn 3 Bot1 casts Preordain (a scry, CR 701.22) and then Consider (a surveil, CR 701.25): each triggers Denzilore once,
# so Bot1's two creatures get two counters each - Denzilore a 5/6, Ornithopter a 2/4 - and Bot2's Ornithopter, a
# creature Bot1 does not control, gets none.

